# Nostos — attributes
#
# Two jobs: keep line endings stable across machines, and stop git from trying
# to diff or merge binary assets it cannot merge.
#
# Git LFS is NOT enabled yet — `git-lfs` is not installed on this machine, and
# declaring `filter=lfs` for a filter that does not exist makes every commit
# touching a matched file fail with an opaque "external filter failed". The LFS
# block below is therefore inert until someone runs `git lfs install`. See
# tasks/known-gaps.md ASSET-1: this must be done BEFORE the first binary asset
# is committed, because converting history afterwards means rewriting it.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only tooling that genuinely needs CRLF.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Shell scripts must stay LF regardless of platform — a CRLF shebang line makes
# the hook guards fail to execute with "bad interpreter".
*.sh text eol=lf

# --- Binary: do not diff, do not attempt to merge ----------------------------
# `binary` is shorthand for `-text -diff`. `-merge` is added explicitly: git's
# default union/ours merge on a binary file produces a corrupt asset that opens
# in the editor and looks fine until it does not.

# Images and textures
*.png binary -merge
*.jpg binary -merge
*.jpeg binary -merge
*.tga binary -merge
*.psd binary -merge
*.exr binary -merge
*.hdr binary -merge
*.dds binary -merge
*.ktx binary -merge
*.ktx2 binary -merge
*.basis binary -merge

# Audio
*.wav binary -merge
*.ogg binary -merge
*.mp3 binary -merge
*.flac binary -merge
*.bank binary -merge
*.fsb binary -merge

# Video
*.mp4 binary -merge
*.webm binary -merge
*.mov binary -merge
*.bk2 binary -merge

# Models and animation
*.fbx binary -merge
*.glb binary -merge
*.blend binary -merge
*.obj binary -merge
*.abc binary -merge

# Fonts
*.ttf binary -merge
*.otf binary -merge
*.woff binary -merge
*.woff2 binary -merge

# Engine-authored binaries
*.uasset binary -merge
*.umap binary -merge
*.res binary -merge
*.pak binary -merge
*.bundle binary -merge

# Archives
*.zip binary -merge
*.7z binary -merge

# --- Git LFS (inert until `git lfs install` — see header) --------------------
